Okay, evaluating the 'Audi A4 FSI' requires focusing on a specific generation and engine since 'FSI' isn't a trim level but an engine type used across different A4 models. Based on the request for the "most recent version" where FSI was applicable, I will evaluate the Audi A4 B7 (2004-2008) with the 2.0 FSI 150 PS engine, as it was a common FSI variant in a relatively recent generation before TFSI became standard.

